      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A long-bodied electric eel, 9 ft. long in the printed encounter."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Special attacks mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Electric discharge · Once an hour, the eel releases a shock in a 15-ft. radius. It deals 3d8 electrical damage within 5 ft., 2d8 from 5 to 10 ft., and 1d8 to everyone else within range."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Encounters mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Reception Pool · The eel attacks disturbances in area 4’s water-filled pit. A character who falls in begins within 5 ft. unless they flee as soon as they spot the eel."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "Neutral, nonintelligent, morale 7. The encounter fixes this eel at 16 HP.",
            "The printed distance bands overlap at exactly 5 ft. The source gives no saving throw for the discharge.",
            "TSR, Corsairs of the Great Sea (1994), Adventure Book p. 24."
          ]
        }
      ],
