          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Special attacks mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Swallow whole · The giant shark can swallow prey when its attack roll is at least 4 above the minimum needed to hit. Swallowed creatures take 20 damage each round. They can attack from within at a cumulative −1 penalty per round. Killing the shark is the only printed escape."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Encounters mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Terrapin Isle · Two giant sharks are listed in the malenti encounter, with 68 HP and 3,000 XP each."
          ]
